---
import SiteLayout from './SiteLayout.astro';
const {frontmatter} = Astro.props;
---
<SiteLayout title={frontmatter.title ?? 'Our Process'} description={frontmatter.description}>
  <article class="article wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Meyo Insights · Research method</p>
    <h1>Our Process</h1>
    <p class="article-deck">How we examine businesses, industries, evidence and investment ideas.</p>
    {frontmatter.author && <p class="muted">By {frontmatter.author}</p>}
    <figure class="process-visual">
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 740px)" srcset="/our-process-sketch-mobile.svg" />
        <img src="/our-process-sketch.svg" loading="eager" width="1550" height="1250" alt="Research workflow showing idea intake, relevance triage, source collection, evidence verification, analysis, drafting, owner editorial review, explicit publication approval, publishing and feedback loops." />
      </picture>
      <figcaption>Research is iterative. Missing evidence leads back to collection; drafts require owner review and separate publication approval. <a href="https://github.com/meyoinsights/meyoinsights.github.io/blob/main/diagrams/our-process.excalidraw">Editable Excalidraw source</a>.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="prose"><slot /></div>
    <p class="related-reading"><a href="/behind-the-research/">See the tools behind our research →</a></p>
    <p class="disclaimer">This page describes our approach to research. It is not an assurance that every report is complete or a source of personalized investment advice.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.process-visual {
  width: min(1280px, calc(100vw - 36px));
  max-width: none;
  margin: 48px 0 56px 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  padding: 26px 18px 16px;
  border: 1px solid #d7e0d7;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: #fffdf8;
}
.process-visual picture, .process-visual img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.process-visual figcaption { margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; color: #536f61; font-size: 13px; }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .process-visual { margin-top: 34px; padding: 12px 6px; border-radius: 12px; }
}
</style>
